Core Pipeline Directives


Environment:  

	Defines global environment variables available across stages.


	environment {
	    DEPLOY_ENV = 'production'
	    DOCKER_REGISTRY = 'registry.example.com'
	}

----------------------------------------------------------------------

Parameters:

	Allows user input when triggering a pipeline.


	parameters {
	    string(name: 'BRANCH', defaultValue: 'main', description: 'Branch to build')
	    booleanParam(name: 'RUN_TESTS', defaultValue: true, description: 'Run unit tests?')
	}


----------------------------------------------------------------------


when: 

	Conditional execution of stages.

	
	when {
	    branch 'main'
	}

-----------------------------------------------------------------------


input: 

	Manual approval step.


	input {
	    message "Deploy to production?"
	    ok "Yes, deploy"
	}


--------------------------------------------------------------------



post: 

	Actions after stage completion (success, failure, always).

	post {
	    success {
	        echo 'Deployment succeeded!'
	    }
	    failure {
	        echo 'Deployment failed!'
	    }
	    always {
	        cleanWs()
	    }
	}


----------------------------------------------------------------------


options:

	it Controls the pipeline behavior.


	options {
	    timeout(time: 5, unit: 'MINUTES')
	    retry(2)
	    buildDiscarder(logRotator(numToKeepStr: '10'))
	}

---------------------------------------------------------------------

Branch-Based Deployment Conditions:


	Deploy only from main branch:

	groovy
	when {
	    branch 'main'
	}


---------------------------------------------------------------------


Different environments per branch:


	stages {
	    stage('Deploy') {
	        when {
	            anyOf {
	                branch 'develop'
	                branch 'release/*'
	            }
	        }
	        steps {
	            script {
	                if (env.BRANCH_NAME == 'develop') {
	                    sh './deploy.sh staging'
	                } else {
	                    sh './deploy.sh production'
	                }
	            }
	        }
	    }
	}



